WEBVTT

00:08.840 --> 00:15.440
<b>Dareka ga sutete-shimatta
kinou o hiroi-age</b>

00:15.440 --> 00:18.780
<b>Gamushara ni te o nobashita</b>

00:18.780 --> 00:22.080
<b>Kotae o tsukitsukete</b>

00:22.080 --> 00:27.550
<b>Nani o te ni iretemo
manzoku suru koto wa nai</b>

00:28.720 --> 00:34.660
<b>Fukuzatsu ni karanda kokoro
no sukima kara nigedase</b>

00:34.660 --> 00:36.730
<b>Sou sa, make a treasure</b>

00:36.730 --> 00:41.970
<b>Sabitsuita toki no naka
ni kimi no koe o kiku</b>

00:41.970 --> 00:45.010
<b>Kono mama todoketai</b>

00:45.010 --> 00:48.280
<b>Hikari no naka kimi ga matteru</b>

00:48.280 --> 00:51.910
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

00:51.910 --> 00:55.510
<b>Ima sugu ni</b>

01:06.090 --> 01:08.130
<b>Dakara, make a treasure</b>

01:08.130 --> 01:13.370
<b>Sabitsuita kagami no
naka jibun o sagashite</b>

01:13.370 --> 01:16.470
<b>Kono te de tsukamitai</b>

01:16.470 --> 01:19.710
<b>Doko ni itemo kimi ga matteru</b>

01:19.710 --> 01:23.280
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

01:23.280 --> 01:25.940
<b>Ima sugu ni</b>

01:32.520 --> 01:34.720
<b>Things that don't change are stupid.</b>

01:36.090 --> 01:37.560
<b>They're just boring.</b>

01:38.990 --> 01:40.900
<b>Looking back,</b>

01:40.900 --> 01:43.000
<b>maybe that time five
hundred years ago was</b>

01:43.000 --> 01:45.060
<b>when everyone shone the most.</b>

01:46.870 --> 01:50.460
<b>You and Konzen's group too.</b>

02:01.120 --> 02:04.450
<b>Let go! That hurts! Don't pull!</b>

02:04.450 --> 02:07.890
<b>You said you'd feed me
something, you liar!</b>

02:12.160 --> 02:13.630
<b>Wow!</b>

02:15.060 --> 02:16.330
<b>What is it?</b>

02:16.330 --> 02:16.570
<b>It's so shiny!
What is it?</b>

02:16.570 --> 02:18.270
<b>It's so shiny!</b>

02:18.270 --> 02:19.730
<b>It's like the sun!</b>

02:20.440 --> 02:22.070
<b>The sun?</b>

02:22.070 --> 02:25.100
<b>Oh, please forgive his
transgression, Lord Konzen Douji!</b>

02:31.010 --> 02:32.480
<b>Sorry.</b>

02:36.280 --> 02:38.290
<b>What the hell'd you do
that for, you monkey?!</b>

02:38.290 --> 02:39.960
<b>What?! What's wrong?!
I said I was sorry!</b>

02:39.960 --> 02:41.690
<b>Don't mess with me!
What?! What's wrong?!
I said I was sorry!</b>

02:41.690 --> 02:45.130
<b>Oh, how can this be happening?!</b>

02:45.130 --> 02:46.930
<b>Hey, Egan.</b>

02:46.930 --> 02:49.760
<b>We just have to keep
that brat here, right?</b>

02:50.600 --> 02:53.360
<b>We'll take care of him here.</b>

02:54.440 --> 02:57.140
<b>What are you saying,
Merciful Goddess?!</b>

02:57.140 --> 03:00.540
<b>You've never even
kept a houseplant!</b>

03:00.540 --> 03:04.910
<b>How rude! Who said I
was going to keep him?</b>

03:06.650 --> 03:09.880
<b>I'll leave the entire matter in
the hands of Konzen, my nephew.</b>

03:10.990 --> 03:14.420
<b>What the hell are you
saying, you old hag?!</b>

03:14.420 --> 03:17.490
<b>It's the Merciful Goddess's
mandate, accept it gratefully.</b>

03:17.490 --> 03:19.980
<b>Give him a name, since you're
going to be keeping him.</b>

03:21.330 --> 03:22.800
<b>Like the sun?</b>

03:23.830 --> 03:28.130
<b>That's a great pickup line, Konzen.</b>

03:34.010 --> 03:35.510
<b>General!</b>

03:35.510 --> 03:36.980
<b>General Kenren!</b>

03:37.880 --> 03:40.470
<b>Where in the world did he go?</b>

03:46.960 --> 03:49.050
<b>Excusing yourself from the banquet
and serving wine to yourself?</b>

03:49.960 --> 03:51.160
<b>Oh, you?</b>

03:51.160 --> 03:51.460
<b>Poor things, your subordinates are
desperately searching for you.
Oh, you?</b>

03:51.460 --> 03:55.020
<b>Poor things, your subordinates are
desperately searching for you.</b>

03:55.660 --> 03:57.730
<b>Give me a break.</b>

03:57.730 --> 04:01.290
<b>I don't wanna drink wine while
sucking up to those geezers.</b>

04:01.900 --> 04:06.140
<b>I won't deny that, but we
ought to respect the elderly.</b>

04:06.140 --> 04:09.600
<b>They're still higher-ranking
gods after all,</b>

04:10.580 --> 04:12.380
<b>General Kenren.</b>

04:12.380 --> 04:16.620
<b>Speaking of which, you sure it's
okay for you to be loitering here,</b>

04:16.620 --> 04:18.290
<b>Field Marshal Tenpou?</b>

04:18.290 --> 04:21.260
<b>When the general is absent, it's
the adjutant's turn to step up.</b>

04:22.390 --> 04:24.360
<b>No, thank you, it's
too much of a bother.</b>

04:25.160 --> 04:26.630
<b>Oh, really.</b>

04:27.660 --> 04:31.670
<b>Flowers are great.
Women are great too.</b>

04:31.670 --> 04:35.840
<b>And with some good wine,
what more could you want?</b>

04:35.840 --> 04:37.300
<b>Kenren...</b>

04:38.110 --> 04:43.340
<b>I suppose you've never
experienced deathly boredom.</b>

04:44.480 --> 04:45.880
<b>What the heck are you saying?</b>

04:45.880 --> 04:45.980
<b>I know one such man.
What the heck are you saying?</b>

04:45.980 --> 04:47.720
<b>I know one such man.</b>

04:47.720 --> 04:49.250
<b>He doesn't know what it
is to appreciate flowers,</b>

04:49.250 --> 04:54.020
<b>to be intimate with
women or to enjoy wine,</b>

04:54.020 --> 04:55.850
<b>a man who always looks irate.</b>

04:57.330 --> 04:58.820
<b>What a boring guy.</b>

05:00.600 --> 05:03.960
<b>Pickup line, my ass! She dumped
all the trouble onto me!</b>

05:04.570 --> 05:07.640
<b>Where the hell did that
little monkey go now?!</b>

05:07.640 --> 05:10.010
<b>Lord Konzen, what is it this time?</b>

05:10.010 --> 05:13.110
<b>He made origami figures
out of important documents!</b>

05:13.110 --> 05:14.710
<b>You guys go look too!</b>

05:14.710 --> 05:15.610
<b>Yes, Sir!</b>

05:15.610 --> 05:16.180
<b>He's not getting away with it
this time! I swear I'll kill him!
Yes, Sir!</b>

05:16.180 --> 05:18.980
<b>He's not getting away with it
this time! I swear I'll kill him!</b>

05:18.980 --> 05:20.450
<b>Scary...</b>

05:24.320 --> 05:27.720
<b>He's got a pretty face, but
he gets angry real easy.</b>

05:27.720 --> 05:29.590
<b>And he hits me a lot too.</b>

05:29.590 --> 05:31.020
<b>I guess I'll go hide for now.</b>

05:35.600 --> 05:37.430
<b>That they're heavy...</b>

05:37.430 --> 05:39.170
<b>That they hurt...</b>

05:39.170 --> 05:40.630
<b>That they're cold...</b>

05:41.370 --> 05:43.670
<b>Those things aren't
that big a deal,</b>

05:45.510 --> 05:46.970
<b>but they get in the way.</b>

05:47.810 --> 05:49.300
<b>I don't really get it,</b>

05:50.210 --> 05:53.510
<b>but maybe I was wrong to be there.</b>

05:55.520 --> 06:00.120
<b>There was a blue sky
and lots of green,</b>

06:00.120 --> 06:03.730
<b>and the water was cool
and the breeze was warm.</b>

06:03.730 --> 06:05.350
<b>The people there were nice too.</b>

06:07.800 --> 06:11.600
<b>Here, everyone seems so
boring for some reason,</b>

06:11.600 --> 06:16.570
<b>but that gold one is
kind of like the sun,</b>

06:16.570 --> 06:18.040
<b>and he's sort of comfortable
to be around.</b>

06:30.550 --> 06:32.020
<b>I wish I could...</b>

06:32.850 --> 06:35.290
<b>I wish I could stay with you
like this forever, Homura.</b>

06:36.830 --> 06:38.990
<b>I'm so juvenile, aren't I?</b>

06:40.630 --> 06:42.150
<b>All I ever do is chase after dreams.</b>

06:52.240 --> 06:53.710
<b>I'll hide in here.</b>

06:55.010 --> 06:56.480
<b>I wonder what this room is for?</b>

06:57.080 --> 06:58.550
<b>Oh, well.</b>

07:01.980 --> 07:03.750
<b>Hey!</b>

07:03.750 --> 07:05.220
<b>Who are you?</b>

07:09.360 --> 07:12.560
<b>A kid? About my age?</b>

07:12.560 --> 07:15.120
<b>Hey, I'm asking who you are.</b>

07:16.200 --> 07:20.760
<b>Well... Who am I?</b>

07:21.570 --> 07:22.440
<b>Lord Nataku?!</b>

07:22.440 --> 07:22.840
<b>Shoot!
Lord Nataku?!</b>

07:22.840 --> 07:24.640
<b>Shoot!
Lord Nataku?</b>

07:24.640 --> 07:25.770
<b>Where are you?</b>

07:25.770 --> 07:26.140
<b>Never mind, this way!
Where are you?</b>

07:26.140 --> 07:27.230
<b>Never mind, this way!</b>

07:28.480 --> 07:29.640
<b>Did you find him?</b>

07:29.640 --> 07:29.980
<b>Are you in here, Lord Nataku?
Did you find him?</b>

07:29.980 --> 07:31.100
<b>Are you in here, Lord Nataku?</b>

07:31.910 --> 07:32.510
<b>How about over there?</b>

07:32.510 --> 07:33.410
<b>What? Where in the world is he hiding?
How about over there?</b>

07:33.410 --> 07:36.020
<b>What? Where in the world is he hiding?</b>

07:36.020 --> 07:37.480
<b>Lord Nataku?!</b>

07:40.660 --> 07:42.120
<b>Morons!</b>

07:43.630 --> 07:46.760
<b>Are you on the run after
doing something bad too?</b>

07:46.760 --> 07:49.000
<b>It's nothing big.</b>

07:49.000 --> 07:51.300
<b>The Jade Emperor's
always so puffed up,</b>

07:51.300 --> 07:53.670
<b>but he was napping with
a dumb look on his face,</b>

07:53.670 --> 07:55.140
<b>so I just drew some
nose hairs on him.</b>

07:57.440 --> 07:58.710
<b>That's cool!</b>

07:58.710 --> 07:58.940
<b>Right, right?!
That's cool!</b>

07:58.940 --> 07:59.740
<b>Right, right?!</b>

07:59.740 --> 08:00.210
<b>Right, right?!
I really would have liked to see that!</b>

08:00.210 --> 08:02.110
<b>I really would have liked to see that!</b>

08:02.110 --> 08:04.910
<b>Oh, I should have taken a picture!</b>

08:05.650 --> 08:07.340
<b>You're a funny guy!</b>

08:07.950 --> 08:09.420
<b>I'm Nataku. What about you?</b>

08:11.450 --> 08:15.820
<b>Well, I don't have a name yet.</b>

08:15.820 --> 08:19.390
<b>I didn't have anyone to
give me one, so...</b>

08:19.390 --> 08:21.060
<b>They say I'm weird.</b>

08:21.060 --> 08:24.130
<b>They say I'm a heretical being
because I was born from a rock.</b>

08:24.130 --> 08:28.760
<b>They said I need to be kept here
because my golden eyes are unlucky.</b>

08:30.870 --> 08:33.770
<b>I don't really get it,
but that's amazing.</b>

08:34.680 --> 08:37.710
<b>There's only one person like
you in the world, right?</b>

08:37.710 --> 08:41.810
<b>That means no one can ever
replace you. Isn't that amazing?</b>

08:43.650 --> 08:45.120
<b>I've found you, Lord Nataku!</b>

08:45.820 --> 08:47.290
<b>You're just so...</b>

08:47.890 --> 08:50.410
<b>You go too far with your pranks!
Please return to the main hall!</b>

08:51.930 --> 08:53.630
<b>All right, all right.</b>

08:53.630 --> 08:55.130
<b>Nataku!</b>

08:55.130 --> 08:58.070
<b>Hey, can we play again?</b>

08:58.070 --> 08:59.530
<b>Yeah, see you around.</b>

09:04.740 --> 09:06.810
<b>You made a friend?</b>

09:06.810 --> 09:09.640
<b>Yes, he's kind of bossy,
but he's a fun guy.</b>

09:09.640 --> 09:11.130
<b>Good for you then.</b>

09:12.550 --> 09:16.880
<b>But about the only kid his age
within these castle walls is...</b>

09:16.880 --> 09:18.350
<b>No way.</b>

09:19.220 --> 09:20.460
<b>What is it?</b>

09:20.460 --> 09:20.720
<b>Hey, Konzen.
What is it?</b>

09:20.720 --> 09:21.920
<b>Hey, Konzen.</b>

09:22.490 --> 09:24.390
<b>Give me a name.</b>

09:25.960 --> 09:27.630
<b>Why are you bringing this up now?</b>

09:27.630 --> 09:31.970
<b>When I see him next time, I want to
tell him my name no matter what!</b>

09:31.970 --> 09:33.700
<b>I want to be called
properly by my name!</b>

09:34.340 --> 09:35.900
<b>So...</b>

09:35.900 --> 09:37.740
<b>I'll get around to it eventually.</b>

09:37.740 --> 09:40.640
<b>No! I want it now! Right now!</b>

09:41.310 --> 09:43.780
<b>Then, Monkey. That's it, Monkey.</b>

09:45.980 --> 09:48.180
<b>Bastard, don't mess with me!</b>

09:53.720 --> 09:55.490
<b>Goku...</b>

09:55.490 --> 09:57.290
<b>You'll be Goku.</b>

09:57.290 --> 10:00.960
<b>It's short and easy, so even a
monkey like you can remember it.</b>

10:01.730 --> 10:03.200
<b>Goku...</b>

10:03.730 --> 10:06.170
<b>Okay, I'm Goku?</b>

10:07.200 --> 10:09.400
<b>Hey, what's it mean?
What's it mean?!</b>

10:09.400 --> 10:10.910
<b>Shut up!</b>

10:10.910 --> 10:12.370
<b>What the heck, you cheapskate?!</b>

10:18.710 --> 10:20.010
<b>Zenon!</b>

10:20.010 --> 10:20.210
<b>Is that you, Shien?
Zenon!</b>

10:20.210 --> 10:21.980
<b>Is that you, Shien?</b>

10:21.980 --> 10:23.850
<b>I've heard, Zenon.</b>

10:23.850 --> 10:25.390
<b>About what?</b>

10:25.390 --> 10:28.950
<b>You seem to be very involved with
the Lower World these days.</b>

10:29.690 --> 10:32.680
<b>I guess. It's great over there.</b>

10:35.360 --> 10:37.970
<b>Much better than this place.</b>

10:37.970 --> 10:41.990
<b>I feel like struggling futilely
through life suits me.</b>

10:42.800 --> 10:44.470
<b>I see.</b>

10:44.470 --> 10:48.170
<b>So, that's how you just
accept everything.</b>

10:49.340 --> 10:52.750
<b>Nope, I just don't like the Heavens.</b>

10:52.750 --> 10:55.150
<b>I'll eventually end up
getting banished too.</b>

11:00.320 --> 11:02.310
<b>Rinrei, we're taking you in!</b>

11:04.560 --> 11:07.500
<b>I heard Rinrei's been incarcerated.</b>

11:07.500 --> 11:10.370
<b>Apparently, she was having
intimate relations with Homura.</b>

11:10.370 --> 11:11.830
<b>Oh, my!</b>

11:12.970 --> 11:14.470
<b>Rinrei...</b>

11:14.470 --> 11:17.370
<b>Hey, is it okay if I take
some of these flowers?</b>

11:18.610 --> 11:20.510
<b>Sure, that's fine.</b>

11:21.380 --> 11:23.180
<b>Thank you!</b>

11:23.180 --> 11:25.740
<b>There's no one to look
at these flowers now.</b>

11:28.780 --> 11:30.750
<b>Chains?</b>

11:30.750 --> 11:32.220
<b>A criminal?</b>

11:32.990 --> 11:35.110
<b>Or is he the same as me?</b>

11:36.320 --> 11:40.090
<b>Hey, my name's Goku.
Mister, what about you?</b>

11:44.730 --> 11:47.260
<b>Man, what a boring guy.</b>

11:49.040 --> 11:53.530
<b>It's certainly become much rowdier
in the short time I've been away.</b>

11:54.580 --> 11:56.180
<b>You could say that.</b>

11:56.180 --> 11:57.750
<b>Konzen!</b>

11:57.750 --> 11:59.810
<b>Oh, you have a guest?</b>

11:59.810 --> 12:01.680
<b>I don't mind.</b>

12:01.680 --> 12:02.680
<b>Please come on in.</b>

12:02.680 --> 12:03.180
<b>I'm... I'm Goku! What
about you, Mister?!
Please come on in.</b>

12:03.180 --> 12:06.150
<b>I'm... I'm Goku! What
about you, Mister?!</b>

12:07.050 --> 12:09.220
<b>Big Brother is Tenpou.</b>

12:09.220 --> 12:12.960
<b>You could say Konzen and
I are old acquaintances.</b>

12:12.960 --> 12:14.800
<b>Please call me Tenchan.</b>

12:14.800 --> 12:17.730
<b>Yay, it's Tenchan!</b>

12:17.730 --> 12:21.370
<b>Tenpou, what the heck's with Tenchan?</b>

12:21.370 --> 12:24.240
<b>I never knew you liked children.</b>

12:25.110 --> 12:27.040
<b>You, Field Marshal of the
Heavenly Western Army</b>

12:27.040 --> 12:28.580
<b>and a military geek to boot.</b>

12:28.580 --> 12:33.140
<b>It's the first time I've ever seen
you looking so lively too.</b>

12:34.020 --> 12:36.640
<b>Goku, is it? What a wonderful name.</b>

12:39.850 --> 12:44.450
<b>One who can perceive the void, that
which can't be seen with the eye.</b>

12:46.430 --> 12:47.890
<b>Shut up.</b>

12:48.560 --> 12:52.090
<b>You've got a troublesome one
over at your end too, don't you?</b>

12:53.370 --> 12:55.740
<b>Oh, I believe we do.</b>

12:55.740 --> 12:58.610
<b>Though he's much larger
than this child here.</b>

12:58.610 --> 13:01.010
<b>His name's Kenren, isn't it?</b>

13:01.010 --> 13:04.380
<b>I hear he's far more skilled than
even some of those war gods.</b>

13:05.650 --> 13:07.650
<b>He does whatever he
damn well pleases,</b>

13:07.650 --> 13:13.520
<b>and he has a sharp mind, so he has
all the more enemies because of it.</b>

13:13.520 --> 13:16.720
<b>The upper ranks of the military
seem to think he's a nuisance too.</b>

13:17.560 --> 13:21.150
<b>That's because the upper ranks
have something to hide, isn't it?</b>

13:21.930 --> 13:24.400
<b>So, you noticed it too?</b>

13:24.400 --> 13:25.870
<b>In my own way.</b>

13:26.500 --> 13:30.960
<b>The recent number of campaigns
even feels rather contrived.</b>

13:33.170 --> 13:37.180
<b>There's no war, not even death
exists here in the Heavens.</b>

13:37.180 --> 13:40.110
<b>The army was only made
to subjugate those</b>

13:40.110 --> 13:42.480
<b>who would ruin the peace and
order of the Lower World.</b>

13:43.220 --> 13:47.210
<b>Yes, I'm interested in the military
history of the Lower World,</b>

13:49.320 --> 13:53.230
<b>but war's essentially a tool for
maintaining your ideology.</b>

13:54.200 --> 13:57.670
<b>Well, it's useless to complain
to you about this though.</b>

13:57.670 --> 13:59.630
<b>I'll come back another time.</b>

13:59.630 --> 14:01.140
<b>Tenpou!</b>

14:01.140 --> 14:02.340
<b>Yes?</b>

14:02.340 --> 14:02.640
<b>A Field Marshal ranks
higher than a General.
Yes?</b>

14:02.640 --> 14:05.610
<b>A Field Marshal ranks
higher than a General.</b>

14:05.610 --> 14:08.640
<b>Why have you contented yourself
with being an adjutant?</b>

14:08.640 --> 14:10.440
<b>I dislike being in the spotlight.</b>

14:11.050 --> 14:12.910
<b>Oh, are you going home, Tenchan?</b>

14:12.910 --> 14:14.380
<b>Yes, goodbye.</b>

14:15.720 --> 14:17.310
<b>Okay, bye-bye.</b>

14:18.150 --> 14:22.420
<b>It's true there's strange activity
going on where I can't see it.</b>

14:23.190 --> 14:25.130
<b>Don't tell me</b>

14:25.130 --> 14:28.790
<b>he's letting the General run loose on
purpose to provoke the upper ranks?</b>

14:30.000 --> 14:32.800
<b>If he is, then talk about an
incredible strategist.</b>

14:34.240 --> 14:38.240
<b>War Prince Nataku, come forth!</b>

14:38.240 --> 14:39.670
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

14:44.310 --> 14:46.880
<b>Here comes Lord Nataku.</b>

14:46.880 --> 14:50.020
<b>He's such a sassy brat,
and he's a war god.</b>

14:50.020 --> 14:52.290
<b>But I hear he can fell a monster</b>

14:52.290 --> 14:54.660
<b>dozens of times taller than
him in one blow.</b>

14:54.660 --> 14:57.630
<b>After all, he's got the devil in him.</b>

14:57.630 --> 15:00.700
<b>We don't even know whose
belly brought him forth...</b>

15:00.700 --> 15:03.720
<b>If you've got something
to say, say it louder.</b>

15:05.930 --> 15:09.200
<b>Nataku, I've summoned you here
for one and only one reason.</b>

15:10.100 --> 15:14.280
<b>There's still a faint trace
of the nose hairs left.</b>

15:14.280 --> 15:16.210
<b>Quiet!</b>

15:16.210 --> 15:20.310
<b>We shall consider such mischief
water under the bridge.</b>

15:20.310 --> 15:23.120
<b>I hereby appoint you to a
task of great importance.</b>

15:23.120 --> 15:24.750
<b>Go to the Lower World.</b>

15:24.750 --> 15:26.650
<b>There is one who devours
humans as he pleases</b>

15:26.650 --> 15:30.290
<b>and disturbs the order
of the Lower World.</b>

15:30.290 --> 15:33.320
<b>You'll subjugate the
great demon, Gyumaoh!</b>

15:34.600 --> 15:38.830
<b>As you wish, my Lord. We gratefully
accept this appointed task.</b>

15:38.830 --> 15:40.570
<b>They're all such morons.</b>

15:40.570 --> 15:43.640
<b>Gyumaoh possesses such
incredible strength.</b>

15:43.640 --> 15:45.540
<b>He's even been called
the God of Destruction.</b>

15:45.540 --> 15:48.980
<b>However, I'm sure he'll
be helpless before you.</b>

15:49.780 --> 15:53.110
<b>Our ability's poor, but we shall
not fail to bring him down.</b>

15:54.350 --> 15:57.250
<b>You will go, will you not, Nataku?</b>

15:57.250 --> 16:01.210
<b>In the end, I'm nothing but a puppet
assassin to you guys, right?</b>

16:03.020 --> 16:04.490
<b>As you wish.</b>

16:05.660 --> 16:08.190
<b>I won't grow up to become
an adult like you guys.</b>

16:09.200 --> 16:10.660
<b>Not ever.</b>

16:11.270 --> 16:14.340
<b>Is that understood?
Nataku will fight alone.</b>

16:14.340 --> 16:18.040
<b>None of you must interfere.</b>

16:18.040 --> 16:21.030
<b>Lord Li Touten, then our
purpose in going will be...</b>

16:22.210 --> 16:24.550
<b>All you need do is see it through!</b>

16:24.550 --> 16:26.600
<b>This is an order!
Do you understand?</b>

16:28.280 --> 16:29.750
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

16:40.130 --> 16:41.590
<b>Hey!</b>

16:42.560 --> 16:47.030
<b>You could at least greet your
superior officer when you pass him.</b>

16:47.030 --> 16:49.030
<b>Oh, sorry about that.</b>

16:49.800 --> 16:51.270
<b>Hello...</b>

16:52.110 --> 16:53.610
<b>Goodbye.</b>

16:53.610 --> 16:55.210
<b>General Kenren!</b>

16:55.210 --> 16:59.610
<b>What is it now? I'm busy
too, you know?</b>

16:59.610 --> 17:03.120
<b>That coming from a man with a wine
bottle hanging from his belt?</b>

17:03.120 --> 17:05.320
<b>Oh, this is fuel, so...</b>

17:05.320 --> 17:08.120
<b>If it were not for
Field Marshal Tenpou,</b>

17:08.120 --> 17:11.090
<b>you'd have been dismissed long ago.</b>

17:11.090 --> 17:13.990
<b>You should be grateful to
your excellent adjutant.</b>

17:16.000 --> 17:20.600
<b>You be careful not to get bitten
by your excellent hound too.</b>

17:20.600 --> 17:21.770
<b>What?</b>

17:21.770 --> 17:22.100
<b>See ya around.
What?</b>

17:22.100 --> 17:23.260
<b>See ya around.</b>

17:25.170 --> 17:27.440
<b>Gojun, Dragon King
of the Western Seas,</b>

17:27.440 --> 17:30.000
<b>an elite career officer
from a clan of war gods.</b>

17:30.910 --> 17:35.610
<b>With his uptight attitude, pale
white skin, and red eyes...</b>

17:36.550 --> 17:39.540
<b>He may be my superior officer,
but I just don't like him.</b>

17:40.650 --> 17:41.760
<b>Here you go.</b>

17:41.760 --> 17:42.160
<b>What's this?
Here you go.</b>

17:42.160 --> 17:43.420
<b>What's this?</b>

17:43.420 --> 17:45.430
<b>It's the late document.</b>

17:45.430 --> 17:49.060
<b>Ever since that monkey came, I
haven't even had time to rest!</b>

17:49.060 --> 17:51.730
<b>Assign these jobs to
someone else, damn it!</b>

17:53.230 --> 17:55.400
<b>You look like you're having fun.</b>

17:55.400 --> 17:57.270
<b>You've have to be kidding!
You've got some nerve</b>

17:57.270 --> 17:59.070
<b>after forcing that bundle
of trouble onto me!</b>

17:59.070 --> 18:01.910
<b>But for all that, you're
being a good daddy.</b>

18:01.910 --> 18:03.440
<b>More importantly,</b>

18:03.440 --> 18:07.280
<b>do you know the Field Marshal
of the Western Army, Tenpou?</b>

18:07.280 --> 18:11.450
<b>Yeah, the pretty-faced boy famous
for being eccentric, right?</b>

18:12.390 --> 18:14.050
<b>What about him?</b>

18:14.050 --> 18:18.090
<b>He's distrustful of the actions
the Heavens' higher-ups are taking.</b>

18:18.090 --> 18:20.490
<b>He's a shrewd guy.</b>

18:20.490 --> 18:23.660
<b>He may eventually become
dangerous to the higher-ups.</b>

18:24.230 --> 18:26.500
<b>He's your friend, right?</b>

18:26.500 --> 18:28.590
<b>You sure you want to be
tattling on him to me?</b>

18:29.670 --> 18:31.640
<b>I'm telling you, because it's you.</b>

18:31.640 --> 18:33.710
<b>I've got nothing to
do with the military,</b>

18:33.710 --> 18:36.270
<b>so I never hear about what
they're thinking up there.</b>

18:37.340 --> 18:41.180
<b>But the recent unrest is
as obvious as daylight.</b>

18:42.120 --> 18:45.280
<b>Too bad, but there are some
things even I don't know.</b>

18:46.690 --> 18:48.520
<b>However...</b>

18:48.520 --> 18:49.490
<b>However?</b>

18:49.490 --> 18:50.020
<b>Oh, it probably isn't a
big deal anyway.
However?</b>

18:50.020 --> 18:51.690
<b>Oh, it probably isn't a
big deal anyway.</b>

18:52.290 --> 18:55.000
<b>Well, I'm in a position
of responsibility too.</b>

18:55.000 --> 18:57.090
<b>I'll be careful in
disciplining my hounds.</b>

18:59.030 --> 19:00.330
<b>What's this?</b>

19:00.330 --> 19:00.530
<b>That monkey just put it
there for decoration.
What's this?</b>

19:00.530 --> 19:03.200
<b>That monkey just put it
there for decoration.</b>

19:03.200 --> 19:04.870
<b>He probably picked it in the area.</b>

19:05.570 --> 19:08.300
<b>Oh, they're pretty.</b>

19:09.840 --> 19:11.310
<b>Yes, that's true.</b>

19:14.950 --> 19:17.950
<b>You've changed, Konzen.</b>

19:17.950 --> 19:20.180
<b>The hell I have!
Hurry up and go home!</b>

19:20.750 --> 19:22.460
<b>What's wrong with that?</b>

19:22.460 --> 19:24.920
<b>Things that don't change are
stupid, don't you think?</b>

19:25.760 --> 19:27.230
<b>They're just boring.</b>

19:31.430 --> 19:32.900
<b>I suppose so.</b>

20:27.150 --> 20:30.690
<b>And time passed quietly</b>

20:30.690 --> 20:33.990
<b>as the wheels of fate
slowly began to turn.</b>

20:46.640 --> 20:55.450
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina
omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

20:56.820 --> 21:07.220
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou no
naka ni ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:08.560 --> 21:18.700
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:20.040 --> 21:33.020
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta
kotoba ga fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:33.020 --> 21:44.470
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:44.470 --> 21:55.740
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi
ga tashika ni natteku</b>

21:55.740 --> 22:07.920
<b>Ima nara kitto aruite
yukeru doko made mo</b>
